WEBVTT

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:07.190
For the dental industry, real-world
evidence is worth a lot.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:11.350
Manufacturers of implants and materials, and
artificial intelligence companies,

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.070
need to know how their products
perform in the practice.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.470
Dental Data offers them that evidence,
organised and under contract:

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.710
questions answered in the
practices and aggregated

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.310
results that come back without
identifiable data.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.610
For practice software vendors, the
connector is a component that

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:34.130
integrates with their product and opens new
services for their customers.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:37.730
The rules do not change: a
contract for each use,

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:41.350
only aggregated results and
never advertising.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:45.080
Real evidence, organised and
under contract.
